      "locked": false,
      "text": "Text at 200% (A11Y-6), on the desktop\napp and the web alike. Layouts switch by\ntext size: the breakpoints count in text\nunits, so 200% on a 1280 px window gets\nthe narrow layout.",
      "originalText": "Text at 200% (A11Y-6), on the desktop\napp and the web alike. Layouts switch by\ntext size: the breakpoints count in text\nunits, so 200% on a 1280 px window gets\nthe narrow layout.",
